00:03:14.608 --> 00:03:15.289
Hurry!

00:03:15.369 --> 00:03:16.168
Let's go.

00:03:16.689 --> 00:03:17.488
Stop her!

00:03:36.529 --> 00:03:37.328
This way!

00:03:37.768 --> 00:03:39.009
- Go!
- This way!

00:03:39.009 --> 00:03:39.809
Is everyone here?

00:03:40.529 --> 00:03:41.328
No one missing?

00:03:41.488 --> 00:03:42.289
Stop her!

00:03:42.849 --> 00:03:43.648
Stop her!

00:03:44.048 --> 00:03:44.849
No one's missing.

00:03:44.849 --> 00:03:45.648
Be careful.

00:03:45.648 --> 00:03:46.448
Go! This way.

00:03:46.768 --> 00:03:47.249
Hurry!

00:03:50.369 --> 00:03:50.928
Xiong.

00:03:51.048 --> 00:03:51.768
Why are you here?

00:03:51.768 --> 00:03:52.529
Locked the car?

00:03:52.529 --> 00:03:53.888
The fire alarm. I came to check.

00:03:53.888 --> 00:03:54.809
Stay with Gou Ya.

00:04:08.608 --> 00:04:09.328
Move!

00:04:10.768 --> 00:04:11.768
Move!

00:04:12.809 --> 00:04:13.809
Watch your step!

00:04:14.208 --> 00:04:15.208
I'm coming out now.

00:04:17.489 --> 00:04:18.848
Go! Let's move.

00:04:19.528 --> 00:04:20.249
A few more floors.

00:04:20.249 --> 00:04:21.009
Don't panic.

00:04:31.768 --> 00:04:32.489
Sun Zhou.

00:08:13.848 --> 00:08:14.528
Ms. Lin.

00:08:14.848 --> 00:08:15.528
Have a seat.

00:08:55.808 --> 00:08:56.969
Have no appetite?

00:08:59.528 --> 00:09:01.048
I ate late at noon.

00:09:01.449 --> 00:09:02.688
Not hungry yet.

00:09:04.408 --> 00:09:06.168
You need to eat properly.

00:09:07.648 --> 00:09:10.528
Slim figures aren't trendy anymore.

00:09:13.129 --> 00:09:15.209
Guys prefer some curves now.

00:09:27.369 --> 00:09:28.168
Ms. Lin.

00:09:29.329 --> 00:09:29.888
I...

00:09:30.489 --> 00:09:31.768
I'm really not hungry.

00:10:37.408 --> 00:10:39.209
Ms. Lin, Gou Ya messed up.

00:11:09.048 --> 00:11:09.849
Are you sure?

00:11:11.009 --> 00:11:13.329
The woman had a fresh wound on her hand.

00:11:13.528 --> 00:11:14.888
Gou Ya just broke free recently,

00:11:14.969 --> 00:11:16.369
couldn't resist the blood scent,

00:11:16.648 --> 00:11:17.528
then went wild.

00:11:17.688 --> 00:11:18.568
What now?

00:11:18.729 --> 00:11:19.768
He's under control now.

00:11:21.089 --> 00:11:21.928
How could it be?

00:11:28.329 --> 00:11:31.129
Trained? A South Mountain Hunter?

00:11:31.489 --> 00:11:32.648
Too dark to see clearly.

00:11:33.288 --> 00:11:34.449
Definitely a woman though.

00:11:35.528 --> 00:11:37.849
I failed to watch over Gou Ya.
Sorry to trouble you.

00:11:40.168 --> 00:11:42.249
We barely managed to place
his blood bag's descendant

00:11:42.249 --> 00:11:43.768
to the welfare house.

00:11:45.209 --> 00:11:47.048
So you mean...

00:11:48.528 --> 00:11:49.688
Bring him back first.

00:11:50.288 --> 00:11:50.849
Understood.

00:11:53.768 --> 00:11:54.329
And

00:11:55.489 --> 00:11:57.168
Yan Tuo was there during the incident.

00:11:58.168 --> 00:11:59.048
Tuo?

00:12:00.249 --> 00:12:01.249
Not his fault.

00:12:01.928 --> 00:12:02.928
I was careless.

00:12:03.168 --> 00:12:05.249
I'll tell you details when I return.

00:12:05.609 --> 00:12:06.329
No.

00:12:07.009 --> 00:12:08.209
I'll come apologize.

00:12:09.200 --> 00:12:09.936
(Xiong Hei)

00:12:28.131 --> 00:12:30.033
(Xiong Hei)

00:12:43.216 --> 00:12:45.392
(New recording)

00:12:57.288 --> 00:12:58.609
Clean this up.

00:12:59.664 --> 00:13:01.332
(New recording)

00:13:16.888 --> 00:13:17.928
Ms. Lin's call.

00:13:21.408 --> 00:13:21.969
Ms. Lin.

00:13:22.969 --> 00:13:24.129
Tuo.

00:13:24.928 --> 00:13:27.688
There's something I need to remind you.

00:13:29.048 --> 00:13:32.209
Our Roadsound Group has grown this big

00:13:32.609 --> 00:13:33.768
with many competitors.

00:13:33.928 --> 00:13:35.729
Some compete fairly,

00:13:36.209 --> 00:13:38.048
while others play dirty.

00:13:39.009 --> 00:13:40.408
The business world is competitive.

00:13:41.329 --> 00:13:43.209
I don't hide things from you on purpose.

00:13:43.729 --> 00:13:45.489
It's to protect you better.

00:13:46.408 --> 00:13:49.048
Can you understand, Tuo?

00:13:50.129 --> 00:13:50.688
I understand.

00:13:51.249 --> 00:13:53.528
But Ms. Lin, I'm not a kid anymore.

00:13:53.688 --> 00:13:54.168
I...

00:13:54.168 --> 00:13:55.849
Xiong Hei has matters to attend to.

00:13:56.329 --> 00:13:57.969
Bring Gou Ya back first.

00:14:02.048 --> 00:14:03.369
What about the client?

00:14:07.729 --> 00:14:09.489
Okay. I'm heading back.

00:14:10.768 --> 00:14:11.808
Drive safely.

00:14:21.888 --> 00:14:22.489
Xiong.

00:15:01.904 --> 00:15:06.160
(Yan A96331)

00:15:08.249 --> 00:15:10.048
(Burn After Reading:
Yan A96331, keep an eye on it.)

00:15:10.048 --> 00:15:15.408
(Nanshan Rescue Team,
Xicang City, Yanguan Province)

00:15:16.646 --> 00:15:18.032
(Emergency Response Kit)

00:15:20.808 --> 00:15:22.369
What a junk!

00:15:24.168 --> 00:15:24.969
Where is it?

00:15:26.209 --> 00:15:27.449
Why the rush?

00:15:39.928 --> 00:15:40.528
Drink.

00:15:44.768 --> 00:15:45.849
Here it is.

00:15:47.288 --> 00:15:48.849
Tap here first, then swipe up.

00:15:49.168 --> 00:15:50.729
See this red dot?

00:15:51.168 --> 00:15:53.009
(Message: Yan A96331, keep an eye on it.)
Just click in. There it is.

00:15:56.489 --> 00:15:59.528
Mr. Crip, only four years apart.

00:15:59.849 --> 00:16:00.969
Got dementia already?

00:16:01.408 --> 00:16:03.009
Get the treatment soon.

00:16:04.408 --> 00:16:06.288
Can you add me into

00:16:06.288 --> 00:16:07.849
the Burn After Reading system?

00:16:07.888 --> 00:16:09.009
After all, starting today,

00:16:09.009 --> 00:16:10.489
I'm one of the hunters.

00:16:10.888 --> 00:16:12.808
Why pull on such a trick?

00:16:13.209 --> 00:16:14.928
Even I couldn't figure it out.

00:16:15.209 --> 00:16:16.849
Can't even handle such a simple task?

00:16:17.129 --> 00:16:18.168
What's wrong with you?

00:16:18.168 --> 00:16:19.609
Are you a fool?

00:16:19.768 --> 00:16:20.729
Send it again.

00:16:22.048 --> 00:16:22.888
What did you say?

00:16:24.288 --> 00:16:25.849
Nothing.

00:16:28.089 --> 00:16:28.729
Jiang.

00:16:29.528 --> 00:16:32.168
That Mad Blade you trained
is finally showing up.

00:16:36.768 --> 00:16:37.888
Just backup support.

00:16:43.288 --> 00:16:44.329
Not going on patrol.

00:16:45.729 --> 00:16:47.808
You've read her message?

00:16:48.928 --> 00:16:49.568
Yes.

00:16:52.129 --> 00:16:53.408
Well, I haven't.

00:16:53.888 --> 00:16:54.408
Jiang.

00:16:54.408 --> 00:16:56.089
Can you tell me what's happening?

00:16:57.768 --> 00:16:59.249
Where were we?

00:17:02.528 --> 00:17:03.249
I forgot.

00:17:04.288 --> 00:17:05.528
Can I start over?

00:17:20.328 --> 00:17:21.009
Go ahead.

00:17:25.449 --> 00:17:27.048
I'm Xiao Gezhi.

00:17:27.328 --> 00:17:29.328
'Gezhi' as in
'Studying the principles of things'.

00:17:29.969 --> 00:17:32.409
Taking over my dad's position.
Today is my first time

00:17:32.409 --> 00:17:34.048
to take on the patrol mission.

00:17:34.088 --> 00:17:35.209
Just call me Shorty.

00:17:35.409 --> 00:17:37.249
Actually, I'm familiar

00:17:37.249 --> 00:17:38.288
with you all here.

00:17:38.368 --> 00:17:39.288
Enough of that.

00:17:39.288 --> 00:17:40.768
Just do what you're told.

00:17:43.889 --> 00:17:44.449
Hello.

00:17:44.568 --> 00:17:45.848
Hello, what's going on?

00:17:47.249 --> 00:17:47.929
You know it?

00:17:48.328 --> 00:17:49.288
Something happened.

00:17:49.288 --> 00:17:50.889
But I don't know what it is.

00:17:51.328 --> 00:17:52.729
A long story. We'll talk later.

00:17:54.128 --> 00:17:55.128
Have you been exposed?

00:17:55.608 --> 00:17:56.209
Probably not.

00:17:57.409 --> 00:17:58.209
Alright.

00:17:59.489 --> 00:18:00.528
Be careful then.

00:18:01.328 --> 00:18:02.249
Keep in touch.

00:18:02.489 --> 00:18:03.288
You too.

00:18:17.209 --> 00:18:18.169
The three clans.

00:18:18.449 --> 00:18:20.128
Blade, Hound, and Whip.

00:18:20.368 --> 00:18:22.608
We Hound Clan have the most members.

00:18:22.889 --> 00:18:24.608
We handle search and assault.

00:18:24.969 --> 00:18:26.808
The Whip Clan uses their whips

00:18:26.929 --> 00:18:28.409
to herd and tame.

00:18:29.128 --> 00:18:30.169
The Blade Clan is special.

00:18:30.649 --> 00:18:32.409
They deliver the critical strikes.

00:18:34.368 --> 00:18:35.768
Speaking of the Hound Clan,

00:18:35.848 --> 00:18:36.889
we must mention

00:18:36.889 --> 00:18:38.808
the leader of South Mountain Hunters,

00:18:38.808 --> 00:18:39.489
Jiang.

00:18:40.368 --> 00:18:42.209
My father mentions his name

00:18:42.409 --> 00:18:43.568
more than my mom's.

00:18:44.929 --> 00:18:45.489
Wait, no.

00:18:45.568 --> 00:18:49.088
Mad Dog leads the charge,
Mad Blade stays in command,

00:18:49.768 --> 00:18:51.808
and Ghost Whip cracks a glowing whip.

00:18:53.088 --> 00:18:55.528
But not just Mad Blade,

00:18:55.729 --> 00:18:57.328
Mad Dog and Ghost Whip are also absent.

00:18:58.848 --> 00:19:00.608
Ghost Whip is overseas,

00:19:01.009 --> 00:19:02.328
not joining this patrol.

00:19:03.449 --> 00:19:05.848
But if needed,

00:19:06.889 --> 00:19:08.288
he'll come immediately.

00:19:09.249 --> 00:19:10.368
Mad Dog lives here.

00:19:10.649 --> 00:19:12.489
He's kind of eccentric.

00:19:13.328 --> 00:19:14.249
I'll fetch him later.

00:19:15.249 --> 00:19:17.489
Others will arrive shortly.

00:19:19.808 --> 00:19:20.568
Jiang.

00:19:22.489 --> 00:19:23.768
Maybe call it off.

00:19:24.889 --> 00:19:27.169
We don't share the same mind,
and can't gather everyone.

00:19:28.128 --> 00:19:29.969
I'll go ask Big Head.

00:19:31.808 --> 00:19:33.768
Exactly! I forgot someone.

00:19:34.009 --> 00:19:35.368
The watchdog Big Head,

00:19:35.568 --> 00:19:37.568
the captain of this rescue center.

00:19:37.729 --> 00:19:39.009
Guests are here already,

00:19:39.009 --> 00:19:39.848
why is he...

00:19:42.528 --> 00:19:43.528
Guests?

00:19:45.689 --> 00:19:46.768
In here,

00:19:47.328 --> 00:19:48.368
we're all family.

00:19:54.704 --> 00:20:00.400
(Nanshan Rescue)

00:20:29.009 --> 00:20:29.608
Hello.

00:20:31.409 --> 00:20:32.288
Done yet?

00:20:34.969 --> 00:20:35.528
No.

00:20:36.169 --> 00:20:38.009
Read Mad Blade's message?

00:20:39.128 --> 00:20:39.848
Yes.

00:20:41.128 --> 00:20:42.768
Yan A96331.

00:20:43.608 --> 00:20:44.288
What model?

00:20:44.409 --> 00:20:45.048
Not sure.

00:20:45.768 --> 00:20:47.249
No follow-up message.

00:20:47.768 --> 00:20:49.409
Newbies can't be trusted.

00:20:49.768 --> 00:20:51.169
Old-timers are aged.

00:20:52.169 --> 00:20:53.889
Key members aren't all here.

00:20:54.808 --> 00:20:56.048
You hurry up.

00:20:57.808 --> 00:20:58.449
Wrap it up...

00:20:58.449 --> 00:20:58.969
Wait.

00:20:59.568 --> 00:21:00.288
What's wrong?

00:21:04.752 --> 00:21:05.296
(Stop)

00:21:10.686 --> 00:21:13.712
(Do Not Enter)

00:21:17.038 --> 00:21:19.856
(Yan A96331)

00:21:27.889 --> 00:21:28.528
Okay.

00:21:35.929 --> 00:21:37.729
What's going on here?

00:21:39.209 --> 00:21:40.009
Where are you going?

00:21:40.288 --> 00:21:41.088
Heading to the city.

00:21:44.048 --> 00:21:44.808
Can't go through.

00:21:45.449 --> 00:21:46.088
Why?

00:21:46.889 --> 00:21:47.808
There's a landslide.

00:21:48.528 --> 00:21:49.969
See the rocks on the ground?

00:21:50.528 --> 00:21:52.729
Just got word.
The situation ahead is worse.

00:21:53.009 --> 00:21:53.848
Roads are all closed.

00:21:54.768 --> 00:21:56.689
S-Should I turn back or...

00:21:56.689 --> 00:21:58.449
No need. Just follow me.

00:22:01.209 --> 00:22:03.209
I'm changing shifts.
I'll lead you the way.

00:22:05.328 --> 00:22:06.249
Behind this mountain

00:22:06.249 --> 00:22:08.489
there's an internal road
for our rescue team.

00:22:09.128 --> 00:22:10.288
Your GPS won't show it.

00:22:11.048 --> 00:22:12.649
The road is rough but shorter.

00:22:13.088 --> 00:22:14.088
Bypass this section,

00:22:14.568 --> 00:22:16.048
turn west and you'll see the highway.

00:22:19.528 --> 00:22:21.048
Alright. Thank you then.

00:22:21.969 --> 00:22:22.848
Follow me.

00:22:22.848 --> 00:22:23.568
Got it.

00:23:13.969 --> 00:23:16.169
Stop wasting time here!

00:23:16.169 --> 00:23:17.288
Listen to me.

00:23:17.288 --> 00:23:18.489
We're already handling it.

00:23:18.489 --> 00:23:19.288
(Binhai Grand Hotel)
We...

00:23:19.288 --> 00:23:20.088
No more excuses.

00:23:20.128 --> 00:23:22.568
What's the use of all that talk?
Does it help?

00:23:22.568 --> 00:23:23.328
Well, listen.

00:23:23.328 --> 00:23:24.929
Let's hear me out. Everyone...

00:23:25.409 --> 00:23:26.528
Alright, how about this?

00:23:26.528 --> 00:23:27.328
We'll compensate.

00:23:27.729 --> 00:23:29.449
- Who's in Room 302?
- No more excuses.

00:23:29.768 --> 00:23:31.409
Please wait a moment.

00:23:31.562 --> 00:23:33.528
- I was here first. Get in line.
- Who are you?

00:23:33.528 --> 00:23:34.568
I'll compensate you.

00:23:34.568 --> 00:23:35.689
I'll compensate you.

00:23:36.048 --> 00:23:36.768
Well, what's...

00:23:36.768 --> 00:23:37.969
Well, what's the matter?

00:23:39.889 --> 00:23:41.848
Tell me who's in Room 302.

00:23:42.368 --> 00:23:43.649
Sir, here's the thing.

00:23:43.969 --> 00:23:45.729
Our hotel regulations

00:23:46.288 --> 00:23:48.768
prohibit disclosing guest information.

00:23:50.128 --> 00:23:51.209
It's about privacy.

00:23:52.249 --> 00:23:54.449
Your hand should get...

00:23:57.528 --> 00:24:00.169
Tell me who's in Room 302.

00:24:00.249 --> 00:24:01.729
And give me surveillance footage

00:24:01.729 --> 00:24:03.649
of the lobby
and the third-floor stairway.

00:24:03.729 --> 00:24:04.209
Stop it.

00:24:04.209 --> 00:24:05.848
Give me the surveillance footage.

00:24:05.848 --> 00:24:06.528
Stop!

00:24:07.409 --> 00:24:08.929
Heard me? Give it to me.

00:24:09.649 --> 00:24:10.649
Don't cause trouble here.

00:24:11.848 --> 00:24:12.689
Stop causing trouble.

00:24:15.009 --> 00:24:15.889
You can't leave.

00:24:16.288 --> 00:24:17.009
You can't leave.

00:24:18.088 --> 00:24:19.288
Think you can get away?

00:24:20.768 --> 00:24:21.328
You hit him.

00:24:23.288 --> 00:24:24.128
What's going on?

00:24:27.009 --> 00:24:28.568
Y-You finally came.

00:24:28.568 --> 00:24:29.328
You finally came.

00:24:29.929 --> 00:24:30.649
He hit us.

00:24:31.368 --> 00:24:32.608
Look at my injuries.

00:24:33.449 --> 00:24:34.449
Are you the manager?

00:24:34.768 --> 00:24:35.288
I am.

00:24:36.969 --> 00:24:37.608
He hit me.

00:25:01.424 --> 00:25:03.792
(I smell)

00:25:15.449 --> 00:25:16.848
(Burn After Reading: I smell the Fiend.)

00:25:21.430 --> 00:25:22.063
(New Message)

00:25:22.180 --> 00:25:23.521
(Burn After Reading: I smell the Fiend.)

00:25:25.489 --> 00:25:27.409
(Burn After Reading: I smell the Fiend.)

00:26:03.568 --> 00:26:05.608
Hello, Xicang Traffic
Information Center.

00:26:05.689 --> 00:26:06.368
Hi.

00:26:06.608 --> 00:26:07.288
May I ask

00:26:07.768 --> 00:26:09.209
Jingyun Road is currently closed?

00:26:09.209 --> 00:26:10.048
Is there an accident?

00:26:10.409 --> 00:26:11.048
Jingyun Road?

00:26:11.048 --> 00:26:12.368
Yes, it's in Fenglai District.

00:26:12.608 --> 00:26:14.169
I saw road rescue crews

00:26:14.409 --> 00:26:15.649
mentioning a landslide.

00:26:16.088 --> 00:26:17.729
There was indeed a landslide earlier,

00:26:17.848 --> 00:26:19.848
but we haven't received
road closure updates.

00:26:19.848 --> 00:26:20.649
So it's not closed?

00:26:20.729 --> 00:26:21.249
Correct.

00:26:21.249 --> 00:26:23.449
Debris should've been cleared already.

00:26:23.449 --> 00:26:25.009
So it's passable now, right?

00:26:25.169 --> 00:26:26.048
Currently, yes.

00:26:26.889 --> 00:26:27.848
I see. Thank you.

00:26:27.969 --> 00:26:28.568
You're welcome.

00:26:28.848 --> 00:26:29.848
Is there anything else...

00:31:42.864 --> 00:31:43.536
(New Message)

00:31:47.328 --> 00:31:48.808
(I lost it.)

00:31:48.808 --> 00:31:51.649
(The Fiend is definitely
in the car Mad Blade mentioned)

00:33:33.889 --> 00:33:35.328
If you keep damaging things,

00:33:38.328 --> 00:33:39.929
I won't buy you toys anymore.

00:33:43.048 --> 00:33:43.889
You'll have

00:33:45.169 --> 00:33:47.088
to lay low for a while.

00:33:48.328 --> 00:33:50.169
South Mountain Hunters
are everywhere now.

00:33:52.328 --> 00:33:53.969
I can't take you out for walks anymore.

00:33:55.009 --> 00:33:56.528
But the Turquoise Land patrol

00:33:57.608 --> 00:33:58.929
only happens every four years.

00:34:01.048 --> 00:34:01.729
Bear with it.

00:34:03.328 --> 00:34:05.288
Soon we could climb trees again.

00:34:06.969 --> 00:34:08.088
Stay here

00:34:08.648 --> 00:34:10.009
and keep quiet.

00:34:10.329 --> 00:34:11.289
Just behave.

00:34:14.489 --> 00:34:15.289
You heard me?

00:34:17.568 --> 00:34:18.289
Locust.

00:34:28.969 --> 00:34:30.969
Big Head says he smells the Fiend.

00:34:41.809 --> 00:34:42.648
He is on a mission.

00:34:43.369 --> 00:34:44.336
Definitely not Locust.

00:35:22.832 --> 00:35:31.480
♪Your past shines brightly,
your path ahead wide and open♪

00:35:31.600 --> 00:35:39.152
♪My future shines with starlight,
awaiting rhythm's embrace♪

00:35:40.144 --> 00:35:44.680
♪Our burdens weigh uncertain,
where tomorrow's road may turn♪

00:35:44.680 --> 00:35:48.960
♪Our hands can't grasp
today's sharp edge♪

00:35:48.960 --> 00:35:55.600
♪Scars endured will give birth to hope♪

00:35:55.600 --> 00:35:59.248
♪Heaven-forged fire
scorches flesh and bone♪

00:35:59.760 --> 00:36:03.792
♪Dig out the truth buried
beneath the earth♪

00:36:03.984 --> 00:36:08.560
♪Heaven-sent tides can't
quench this reckless fire♪

00:36:08.560 --> 00:36:12.880
♪If we don't retreat,
we'll go through it together♪

00:36:12.880 --> 00:36:17.200
♪Heaven-forged fire
lights up the endless night♪

00:36:17.264 --> 00:36:21.464
♪Ripping apart the hidden truth
beneath the surface♪

00:36:21.464 --> 00:36:25.824
♪Heaven-sent tides can't
drown this stubborn flame♪

00:36:25.896 --> 00:36:33.664
♪Farewell to the old times,
and scenes fade away one by one♪

00:36:53.184 --> 00:36:57.544
♪The shapeless fire
clings to matter to illuminate♪

00:36:57.544 --> 00:37:01.864
♪Yet malice in darkness
defies the flame's pursuit♪

00:37:01.864 --> 00:37:06.304
♪A noble name must do righteous deeds♪

00:37:06.304 --> 00:37:08.744
♪After sunrise,
even wise words falter in truth♪

00:37:08.744 --> 00:37:12.824
♪Heaven-forged fire
scorches flesh and bone♪

00:37:12.824 --> 00:37:17.184
♪Dig out the truth buried
beneath the earth♪

00:37:17.184 --> 00:37:21.544
♪Heaven-sent tides can't
quench this reckless fire♪

00:37:21.544 --> 00:37:25.904
♪If we don't retreat,
we'll go through it together♪

00:37:25.904 --> 00:37:30.264
♪Heaven-kindled flames are different♪

00:37:30.264 --> 00:37:34.544
♪Truth's madness is hiding
under the surface♪

00:37:34.544 --> 00:37:39.104
♪The large waves are rolling
towards the sky♪

00:37:39.104 --> 00:37:46.824
♪Farewell to the old times,
and scenes fade away one by one♪